<span id="S3.T1.4.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:290.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The beginning and ending identifiers of an edge detection map image.</span>
</span></td></tr>
