<span id="S3.T1.4.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:290.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The beginning and ending identifiers of a user prompt, which are typically correspond to the user’s instructions or requirements.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.4.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.4.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:153.6pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">&lt;answer&gt; and &lt;/answer&gt;</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:290.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The beginning and ending identifiers of the model’s response.</span>
</span></td></tr>
