<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:50%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span><span id="S6.T5.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation of Text-to-Image Generation on on UniGenBench <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib85" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2025b</a>)</cite></span>. This leadborder is evaluated and maintained by the Tencent Hunyuan team. “Und.” and “Gen.” denote “understanding” and “generation”, respectively. We highlight the <span id="S6.T5.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">best</span> and the <span id="S6.T5.11" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">second</span> results.</figcaption>
