<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span><span id="S6.T6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation of Text-to-Image Generation on OneIG-EN <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chang et al., 2025</a>)</cite> Benchmark.</span> The overall score is the average of the five dimensions. “Und.” and “Gen.” denote “understanding” and “generation”, respectively. We highlight the <span id="S6.T6.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">best</span> and the <span id="S6.T6.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">second</span> results.</figcaption>
