The methods that train a specialist for each task are marked as <span id="S6.T8.12" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">gray color</span>. Except for these methods, we highlight the <span id="S6.T8.13" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">best</span> and the <span id="S6.T8.14" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">second</span> results.</figcaption>
